{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From a Different Angle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 3D puzzle game, you will find yourself in a space laboratory dedicated to studying gravity. You will face numerous challenges that require you to see the world <strong>from a different angle</strong>\u2014because here, gravity can be directed in any direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520800/extras/0ac077765879f13882875417fc2d48fd.poster.avif?t=1773501233\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520800/extras/0ac077765879f13882875417fc2d48fd.webm?t=1773501233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520800/extras/0ac077765879f13882875417fc2d48fd.mp4?t=1773501233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What You'll Find in This Game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of exciting levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 unique interactive objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chance to test your sense of balance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming sections</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the levels created by the developers aren't enough for you, you can create your own! The game features a flexible level editor to bring your ideas to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520800/extras/4595fefc053cb381f08ab26ea56f89de.avif?t=1773501233\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520800/extras_big/4595fefc053cb381f08ab26ea56f89de.avif?t=1773501233 width=800 height=442 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Signal System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level editor includes its own visual programming language to expand your creative possibilities. It allows you to transform simple signals (such as pressing a button) into more complex computations.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520800/extras/0c72071135742d1243d662dfdbd6e078.avif?t=1773501233\" width=800 height=346 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520800?t=1773501233","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520800?t=1773501233","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520800/27cdfa28fc2412562a46b1ddcce0da23111fceee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773501233","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520800/27cdfa28fc2412562a46b1ddcce0da23111fceee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773501233","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3577460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From a Different Angle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 3D puzzle game, you will find yourself in a space laboratory dedicated to studying gravity. You will face numerous challenges that require you to see the world <strong>from a different angle</strong>\u2014because here, gravity can be directed in any direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://s